{
  "$Comment": "The Carving Bench station (id hallows_eve_carving_bench, its file name in lower case). Two actions, in priority order: Carve_Hallowed runs when you hold a Hallowed Pumpkin, and only while Hallow's Eve runs (its Requires reads ziggfreedcommon:calendar_live, so off-season the bench turns the press away); Carve runs for anything else, all year. Each works from your bag, one recipe row per cycle. With more than one row a sneaking press opens the picker so you choose the row, and a plain press runs the first row your bag can pay for. Rows are Recipe.Conversions: change an Input or Output Quantity to rebalance, or add a row. Work.CycleMs is the time one carve takes.",
  "Identity": {
    "NameKey": "rpgstations.station.hallows_eve_carving_bench.name",
